@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Mindfulness Program - W07 Designer Draft
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F1F6FB
skinparam classBorderColor #284B63
skinparam ArrowColor #284B63
skinparam nodesep 50
skinparam ranksep 65
hide circle
class Activity {
  - _name : string
  - _description : string
  - _duration : int
  + Activity(name : string, description : string)
  + GetDuration() : int
  + DisplayStartingMessage() : void
  + DisplayEndingMessage() : void
  + ShowSpinner(seconds : int) : void
  + ShowCountDown(seconds : int) : void
}
class BreathingActivity {
  + BreathingActivity()
  + Run() : void
}
class ReflectingActivity {
  - _prompts : List<string>
  - _questions : List<string>
  - _availableQuestions : List<string>
  - _random : Random
  + ReflectingActivity()
  + Run() : void
  - GetRandomQuestion() : string
}
class ListingActivity {
  - _prompts : List<string>
  - _random : Random
  + ListingActivity()
  + Run() : void
  - GetListFromUser() : List<string>
}
class Program {
  - {static} Main(args : string[]) : void
}
Activity <|-- BreathingActivity
Activity <|-- ReflectingActivity
Activity <|-- ListingActivity
Program ..> BreathingActivity : creates / calls Run()
Program ..> ReflectingActivity : creates / calls Run()
Program ..> ListingActivity : creates / calls Run()
note top of Activity
Shared state and behavior stay in Activity.
Derived constructors call base(name, description).
Private fields are accessed through methods.
end note
note bottom of BreathingActivity
No additional fields needed.
Alternates breathing countdowns.
end note
note bottom of ReflectingActivity
Random prompt and timed questions.
Extra: no question repeats until all are used.
end note
note bottom of ListingActivity
Random prompt and timed keyboard input.
Displays the count of submitted entries.
end note
note as Interaction
<b>How the classes interact</b>
1. Program displays the menu and calls the selected activity's Run().
2. Each derived constructor calls Activity's constructor with its name and description.
3. Run() calls DisplayStartingMessage() to request duration and show a preparation spinner.
4. BreathingActivity alternates breathing instructions using ShowCountDown().
5. ReflectingActivity selects a prompt, then questions using GetRandomQuestion().
   ShowSpinner() gives time to reflect; questions do not repeat until all are used.
6. ListingActivity selects a prompt and calls GetListFromUser() for timed input.
   It counts nonblank entries submitted with Enter and displays the total.
7. Each Run() calls DisplayEndingMessage(), then returns to Program's menu.
   Activity keeps shared fields private; derived classes use GetDuration().
end note
Program -[hidden]down- Interaction
legend bottom
+ public    - private    ~ internal
Hollow triangle: inheritance, pointing to Activity.
Dashed arrow: Program uses the activity.
endlegend
@enduml

